        "body": "Ouster, Inc. is a public company headquartered in San Francisco, California, and trades under the ticker OUST. Its registration with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission carries the CIK number 0001816581. The company's website describes it as a maker of digital lidar sensors, which it says transform autonomy in vehicles, robotics, drones, automation, and smart cities.\n\nThe site also quotes Matt Reiland, Technical Director, Automation Innovation at Komatsu, who says that products developed through a partnership between the two companies can withstand the shock, vibration and temperature constraints of harsh mining environments while delivering the range and spatial awareness needed to operate there. Ouster describes its own technology as cutting-edge.\n\nBeyond the corporate profile, the material available on the company is limited: no products are tracked for it, and no litigation or other legal cases are listed.",
